<description>The tent roof can break direct overhead EO/thermal line of sight and reduce exposure to overhead UAV sensors. It does not make the player thermally invisible; the open walls leave the player visible from lateral and ground-level angles.</description>
<Point>
<coordinates>-64.8245037521885,18.30307739630446,15.91409836349427</coordinates>
